tb520fu-input contains logic ported from the Lenovo ZUI system services of the
stock TB710FU firmware (services.jar: com.zui.server.input.*,
com.lenovo.lgsi.server.battery.*), including GATT UUIDs, command encodings,
broadcast contracts and settings keys used by the Lenovo PenService and
ZuiUDevice apps. That part is Lenovo-derived and is only meant for this
non-commercial unofficial build; it is not covered by the Apache-2.0 header
of the surrounding glue code.
